            "review_title": "Review at Pho Bo Hang Dong",
            "review_text": "Darryn G\nSydney, Australia40 contributions\n0\nDinner in Hanoi\nMar 2019 • Couples\nNot an expert on Vietnamese food but have had a few Pho back in Aus over the years. Pho Bo was tasty and fresh. Restaurant was authentic and clean. Small venue but good ambience with local patrons present. Well priced meal for dinner with plenty of favour.\nWritten March 12, 2019",
